#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Astronomical Device Control with <acronym>INDI</acronym>"
msgstr "Astronomsko Upravljanje Uređaja sa<acronym>INDI</acronym>"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Control"
msgstr "INDI Kontrola"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; provides an interface to configure and control astronomical "
"instruments via the <acronym><link linkend=\"what-is-indi\">INDI</link></"
"acronym> protocol."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; pruža interfejs za konfiguriranje i upravljanje astronomskih  "
"instrumenata putem <acronym><link linkend=\"what-is-indi\">INDI</link></"
"acronym> protokola."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <acronym>INDI</acronym> protocol supports a variety of astronomical "
"instruments such as CCD cameras and focusers. For an up to date list of "
"supported devices, please visit <acronym>INDI</acronym> <ulink url=\"http://"
"indilib.org/index.php?title=Devices\">supported devices page</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>INDI</acronym> protokol podržava razne astronomske instrumente "
"poput CCD kamere i focusers. Za ažuran popis podržanih uređaja, molimo vas "
"da posjetite <acronym>INDI</acronym> <ulink url = \"http://indilib.org/index."
"php?title=Devices\"> stranicu podrzanih uređaja </ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Setup"
msgstr "INDI Postava"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:15 indi.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>INDI</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>INDI</primary>"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:16 indi.docbook:52 indi.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Postava"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; can control local and remote devices seamlessly via the <link "
"linkend=\"what-is-indi\">INDI</link> server/client architecture. INDI "
"devices may be run in three different modes:"
msgstr ""
"&kstars; može kontrolirati lokalne i udaljene uređaje s lakoćom preko<link "
"linkend=\"what-is-indi\">INDI</link> server / klijent arhitekture. INDI "
"uređaji mogu se izvoditi u tri različita načina:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Local: The local mode is the most common and is used to control local device "
"(&ie; a device attached to your machine)."
msgstr ""
"Lokalni: Lokalni način je najčešći i koristi se za kontrolu lokalni uređaj "
"(&ie; uređaj priključen na vašem računalu)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Server: The server mode establishes an INDI server for a particular device "
"and waits for connections from remote clients. You cannot operate server "
"devices, you can only start and shut them down."
msgstr ""
"Server: Način poslužitelj uspostavlja INDI poslužitelj za određeni uređaj i "
"čeka veze s udaljenim klijentima. Vi ne možete rserver uređajima , možete "
"samo početi i zatvori ih."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Client: The client mode is used to connect to remote INDI servers running "
"INDI devices. You can control remote devices seamlessly like local devices."
msgstr ""
"Klijent: Način klijent se koristi za povezivanje   kontrole INDI serveria "
"sa  pokrenutim INDI uređajima. Možete kontrolirati udaljenim uređajima "
"neprimjetno poput lokalnih uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can run local device, establish INDI servers, and connect to remote "
"clients from the <guimenuitem>Device Manager</guimenuitem> in the "
"<guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti lokalni uređaj, uspostaviti Indi poslužitelja, a "
"povezivanje s udaljenim klijentima iz<guimenuitem> Upraviteljom uređaja</"
"guimenuitem> u <guimenu>Uređaji </guimenu>meniu ."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here is a screenshot of the <guilabel>Device Manager</guilabel> window:"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je slika ekrana od  <guilabel>Uravitelj Uređaja </guilabel> prozora:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: indi.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Running device drivers"
msgstr "Pokrenuti drajveri uređaja"

#. Tag: phrase
#: indi.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start device drivers"
msgstr "Pokreni drajvere uređaja"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can run devices by browsing the device tree, selecting a specific "
"device, and then clicking on the <guibutton>Run Service</guibutton> button. "
"You can select the operation mode, either local or server as defined above. "
"The port number is randomly generated between the range from 7624 to 10,000. "
"To specify a port, click on the port column next to the desired driver. "
"&kstars; allows multiple drivers to run under one INDI server, and hence one "
"port. Select multiple drivers then press <guibutton>Run Service</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti uređaje pregledavanjem  stabla uređaja, odabirom određenog "
"uređaja, a zatim kliknite na  <guibutton>Pokreni Servis </guibutton> gumb. "
"Možete odabrati način rada, lokalni ili poslužitelj kao što je gore "
"definirano.Broj porta nasumično generira između rasponu od 7624 do 10.000. "
"Da biste odredili port , kliknite na port kolonu pokraj željenog drajvera. "
"&kstars; omogućuje više drajvera pokrenutih pod jednim INDI poslužiteljem, a "
"time i jedan port. Odaberite  više drajvera i pritisnite  <guibutton>Pokreni "
"Servis </guibutton> gumb."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To control remove devices, refer to the <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control"
"\">remote device control</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Za kontrolu udaljenih uređaja, potrazite <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control"
"\">Daljinskki uravljacki uređaja </link> sekciju."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Telescope Setup"
msgstr "Postavka Teleskopa"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most telescopes are equipped with <hardware>RS232</hardware> interface for "
"remote control. Connect the RS232 jack in your telescope to your computer's "
"<hardware>Serial/USB</hardware> port. Traditionally, the RS232 connects to "
"the serial port of your computer, but since many new laptops abandoned the "
"serial port in favor of <hardware>USB/FireWire</hardware> ports, you might "
"need to obtain a Serial to USB adaptor to use with new laptops."
msgstr ""
"Većina teleskopa je opremljena <hardware>RS232</hardware> interfejsom za "
"daljinsko upravljanje. Spojite RS232 priključak na vašem teleskopu za "
"računarski <hardware>Serijski/USB</hardware>port . Tradicionalno, RS232 se "
"spaja na serijski port računala, ali budući da su mnogi novi laptop "
"napustili serijski port u korist <hardware>USB/FireWire</hardware>porta , "
"možda ćete morati nabaviti Serijski  USB adapter za korištenje na novim "
"laptop uređajima."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After connecting your telescope to the Serial/USB port, turn your telescope "
"on. It is <emphasis>highly</emphasis> recommended that you download and "
"install the latest firmware for your telescope controller."
msgstr ""
"Nakon povezivanja teleskop na Serial / USB priključak, uključite svoj "
"teleskop. To je <emphasis>visko</emphasis> preporuceno da preuzmete i "
"instalirate najnoviji firmware za svoj teleskop kontrolu."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The telescope needs to be aligned before it can be used properly. Align your "
"telescope (one or two stars alignment) as illustrated in your telescope "
"manual."
msgstr ""
"Teleskop mora biti usklađen prije nego što može biti korišten ispravno. "
"Poravnajte svoj teleskop (jedna ili dvije zvijezde za poravnanje) kako je "
"prikazana u teleskop priručniku."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; needs to verify time and location settings before connecting to the "
"telescope. This insures proper tracking and synchronization between the "
"telescope and &kstars;. The following steps will enable you to connect to a "
"device that is connected to your computer. To connect and control remote "
"devices, please refer to <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control\">remote device "
"control</link> section."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; treba provjeriti postavke vremena i mjesta prije spajanja na "
"teleskop. To osigurava pravilno praćenje i sinkronizaciju između teleskopa i "
"&kstars;. Sljedeći koraci će vam omogućiti da spojite na uređaj koji je "
"spojen na računalo. Za povezivanje i kontrolu udaljenog uređaja, pogledajte  "
"<link linkend=\"indi-remote-control\">daljinska kotrola uređaja</"
"link>rubriku."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the Telescope Setup Wizard and it will verify all the required "
"information in the process. It can automatically scan ports for attached "
"telescopes. You can run the wizard by selecting <guimenuitem>Telescope "
"Wizard</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti čarobnjak za teleskop i on  će provjeriti sve potrebne "
"informacije u procesu u.Može automatski skenirati portove u prilogu "
"teleskopa. Možete pokrenuti čarobnjak odabirom <guimenuitem> Teleskop "
"Čarobnjak </guimenuitem> od <guimenu> Uređaji </guimenu> menia."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can connect to a local telescope by performing the "
"following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, mozete se spojiti na lokalni teleskop tako sto cete slijediti "
"sljedeće korake:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set your geographical location. Open the <guilabel>Set Geographic Location</"
"guilabel> window by selecting <guimenuitem>Geographic...</guimenuitem> from "
"the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, or by pressing the <guiicon>Globe</"
"guiicon> icon in the toolbar, or by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>G</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Postavite svoj geografski položaj . Otvorite <guilabel> Postavi Geografski "
"položaj </guilabel> prozor odabirom <guimenuitem> Geographic ... </"
"guimenuitem> od <guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> izbornik, ili pritiskom "
"<guiicon> Globus </guiicon> ikona na alatnoj traci, ili pritiskom na "
"<keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; <keycap> G </keycap> </keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set your local time and date. You can change to any time or date by "
"selecting <guimenuitem>Set Time...</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Time</"
"guimenu> menu, or by pressing the <guiicon>time</guiicon> icon in the "
"toolbar. The <guilabel>Set Time</guilabel> window uses a standard &kde; Date "
"Picker widget. If you ever need to reset the clock back to the current time, "
"just select <guimenuitem>Set Time to Now</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Time</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Postavite vaše lokalno vrijeme i datum. Možete promijeniti bilo koje vrijeme "
"ili datum odabirom <guimenuitem> Postavi vrijeme ... </guimenuitem> na "
"<guimenu> Vrijeme </guimenu> izbornika ili pritiskom na <guiicon> vrijeme </"
"guiicon> ikonu na alatnoj traci ,<guilabel> Postavi vrijeme </guilabel> "
"Prozor koristi standardnu &kde; Alatku za odabir datuma. Ako ste ikada "
"trebati resetovati sat natrag u tekuće vrijeme, samo odaberite <guimenuitem> "
"Postavi vrijeme na trenutno </guimenuitem> na <guimenu> Vrijeme </guimenu> "
"izbornik."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu and select the "
"<guimenuitem>Device Manager</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Klikni  <guimenu>Uređaji </guimenu>meni i selektiraj  <guimenuitem>Upravljac "
"uređajima </guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the <guilabel>Device</guilabel> column, select your telescope model."
msgstr ""
"Ispod  <guilabel>Uređaji</guilabel> kolone, selektirajte model vašeg "
"teleskopa."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Run Service</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Kliknite na  <guibutton>Pokreni  Servis </guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guibutton>Close</guibutton> to leave the Device Manager Dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite<guibutton>Zatvori </guibutton> da se zatvori Upravljač uređajima "
"dialog ."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequent Settings"
msgstr "Česta podešavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not need to set the geographic location and time every time you "
"connect to a telescope. Only adjust the settings as needed."
msgstr ""
"Ne morate da podesite gegrafsku lokaciju i vrijeme savki put kada se "
"konektuje teleskop. Samo  podesite podešavanja koja su potrebna."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are now ready to use the device features, &kstars; conveniently provides "
"two interchangeable GUI interfaces for controlling telescopes:"
msgstr ""
"Sada ste spremni da koristite mogucnosti uređaja,&kstars; nidi mogućnost dva "
"izmjenjiva GUI interfejsa za kontrolu teleskopa:"

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controlling your telescope"
msgstr "Kontrlisanje vaseg teleskopa"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Sky map Control</guilabel>: For each device you run in the "
"<guilabel>Device Manager</guilabel>, a corresponding entry will show up in "
"popup menu that allows you to control the properties of the device. You can "
"issue commands like <command>Slew, Sync,</command> and <command>Track</"
"command> directly from the sky map."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kontrola mape neba</guilabel>: Za svaki uređaj koji pokrećete  "
"u<guilabel>Upravljacu uređaja </guilabel>, odgovarajuci prikaz ce se "
"pokazati u popup meniu sto omogucuje da koristete osobine uređaja.Mozete "
"izdati naredbe poput <command>Mnogo, Sinhroniziraj,</command> i "
"<command>prati </command> direktno sa mape neba."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a screenshot of the popup menu with an active LX200 Classic device:"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je prikaz ekrana od popup menia sa aktivnim LX200 Klasicnim uređajem:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: indi.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controlling devices from sky map"
msgstr "Kontrolisanje uređaja sa mape neba"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>INDI Control Panel</guilabel>: The panel offers the user with all "
"the features supported by a device."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>INDI Kontrolna ploca</guilabel>: Ploca omogućava korisniku sve "
"mogućnosti podržane od strane uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "The panel is divided into three main sections:"
msgstr "Ploča je podjeljenja u tri glavne cjeline:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Device tabs</guilabel>: Each additional active device occupies a "
"tab in the INDI panel. Multiple devices can run simultaneously without "
"affecting the operation of other devices."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel> Kartica Uređaja </guilabel>: Svaki dodatni aktivni uređaj zauzima "
"karticu u INDI ploči. Više uređaja istovremeno može raditi bez utjecaja na "
"rad drugih uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Property views on the <guilabel>Main Control</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Options</guilabel> tabs: Properties are the key element in INDI "
"architecture. Each device defines a set of properties to communicate with "
"the client. The current position of the telescope is an example of a "
"property. Semantically similar properties are usually contained in logical "
"blocks or groupings."
msgstr ""
"Pregleda osobina na <guilabel> Glavnoj  Kontroli  </guilabel> i <guilabel> "
"Opcijama </guilabel> karticama:  Osobine su ključni element u arhitekturi "
"INDI . Svaki uređaj definira skup svojstava za komunikaciju s klijentom."
"Trenutni položaj teleskop je primjer osobine. Semantički slične osobine "
"obično su sadržani u logičkim blokovima ili grupacija."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Log viewer</guilabel>: Devices report their status and acknowledge "
"commands by sending INDI messages. Each device has its own log view. A "
"device usually sends messages to its device driver only, but a device is "
"permitted to send a generic message when appropriate."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel> Preglednik Logova </guilabel>: Uređaji prijavite svoj status i "
"prihvataju naredbe slanjem INDI poruke. Svaki uređaj ima svoj pogled na "
"zapisnik.Uređaj obično šalje poruke do svoga drajvera, no uređaj je "
"dopušteno poslati generički poruku kada je to potrebno."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: indi.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Control Panel"
msgstr "INDI kontrolni panel"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are not restricted on using one interface over another as they can be "
"both used simultaneously. Actions from the <guilabel>Sky map</guilabel> are "
"automatically reflected in the <guilabel>INDI Control Panel</guilabel> and "
"vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Niste ograničeni na korištenje jednog interfejsa nad drugom jer oni mogu "
"biti i koristiti istovremeno. Akcije iz  <guilabel>MApa Neba</guilabel> "
"automatski se odražava u <guilabel> INDI upravljačkoj ploči </guilabel> i "
"obratno."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To connect to your telescope, you can either select <guimenuitem>Connect</"
"guimenuitem> from your device popup menu or alternatively, you can press "
"<guibutton>Connect</guibutton> under your device tab in the <guilabel>INDI "
"Control Panel</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste se povezali na svoj teleskop, možete ili odaberite <guimenuitem> "
"Povezivanje </guimenuitem> sa svog uređaja popup meniu ili alternativno, "
"možete pritisnuti <guibutton> Povezivanje </guibutton> kartici uređaja na  "
"<guilabel> INDI upravljačkoj ploči </guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, &kstars; will try to connect to the <constant>/dev/ttyS0</"
"constant> port. To change the connection port, select <guilabel>INDI Control "
"Panel</guilabel> from the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu and change the "
"port under your device tab."
msgstr ""
"Zadano, &kstars; će pokušati spojiti na  <constant>/dev/ttyS0</constant> "
"port Za promjenu priključka, odaberite<guilabel>INDI Kontrolna Ploča</"
"guilabel> na <guimenu> Uređaji </guimenu> meniju i promijenite port na "
"kartici uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; automatically updates the telescope's longitude, latitude, and time "
"based on current settings in &kstars;. You can enable/disable these updates "
"from <guimenuitem>Configure INDI</guimenuitem> dialog under the "
"<guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; automatski ažurira teleskopske dužinu, širinu i vrijeme na temelju "
"trenutnih postavki u &kstars;. Možete omogućiti / onemogućiti ažuriranja "
"<guimenuitem> Konfiguracija INDI </guimenuitem> dialog ispod <guimenu> "
"Uređaji </guimenu> menia."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If &kstars; communicates successfully with the telescope, it will retrieve "
"the current <abbrev>RA</abbrev> and <abbrev>DEC</abbrev> from the telescope "
"and will display a crosshair on the sky map indicating the telescope "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Ako &kstars; uspješno komunicira s teleskopom, to će dohvatiti trenutne "
"<abbrev> RA </abbrev> i <abbrev> DEC</abbrev> iz teleskopa i prikazat će "
"nišan na mapi neba i ukazuje na položaj teleskop."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synchronizing your telescope"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija vaseg teleskopa"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you aligned your telescope and the last alignment star was, for example, "
"Vega, then the crosshair should be centered around Vega. If the crosshair "
"was off target, then you can <mousebutton>right</mousebutton>-click Vega "
"from the sky map and select <command>Sync</command> from your telescope "
"menu. This action will instruct the telescope to synchronize its internal "
"coordinates to match those of Vega, and the telescope's crosshair should now "
"be centered around Vega."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste poravnali  svoj teleskop i posljednja poravnanje zvijezda je, na "
"primjer, Vega, a zatim nišan treba biti usmjeren oko Vega. Ako nišan je  "
"isključen, onda možete <mousebutton> Desni</mousebutton> -klik Vega na mapi "
"neba i odaberite <command> Sync </command> iz svog teleskopa izbornika. Ova "
"akcija će se uputiti teleskop za sinkronizaciju svojih unutarnjih koordinate "
"odgovaraju onima Vega, a teleskopske nišan sada treba biti usmjeren oko Vega."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is it: your telescope is ready to explore the heavens!"
msgstr "To je to: vaš teleskop je spreman za istraživanje nebesa!"

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "WARNING"
msgstr "UPOZORENJE"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Never use the telescope to look at the sun. Looking at the sun might cause "
"irreversible damage to your eyes and your equipment."
msgstr ""
"Nikada nemojte koristiti teleskop za gledanje sunca. Gledanej sunca moze "
"oštetiti vase oči i opremu."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "CCD and Video-Capture Setup"
msgstr "CCD and Video postvaka"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "CCD Video Control"
msgstr "CCD Video Kontrola"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can run CCD and Video Capture devices from the <guimenuitem>Device "
"Manager</guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu. Like all INDI "
"devices, some of the device controls will be accessible from the skymap. The "
"device can be controlled fully from the <guimenuitem>INDI Control Panel.</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti CCD i Video Capture uređaja iz <guimenuitem> Upravitelja "
"Uređaja </guimenuitem> u <guimenu> Uređaji </guimenu> meniju. Kao i svi INDI "
"uređaja, neke od kontrola uređaja će biti dostupan na mapi neba.Uređaj se "
"može kontrolirati u potpunosti od <guimenuitem> INDI Upravljačke ploče. </"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The standard format for image capture is FITS. Once an image is captured and "
"downloaded, it will be automatically displayed in the &kstars; <link linkend="
"\"tool-fitsviewer\">FITS Viewer</link>. To capture a sequence of images, use "
"the <guimenuitem>Capture Image Sequence</guimenuitem> tool from the "
"<guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu. This tool is inactive until you establish a "
"connection to an image device."
msgstr ""
"Standardni format za snimanja je FITS. Jednom kada je slika uslikna u "
"preuzeta, ona će automatski biti prikazani u &kstars; <link linkend = \"alat-"
"fitsviewer\"> FITS Preglednik </link>. Za snimanje niza slika, koristite "
"<guimenuitem> Uslikaj Vise slika</guimenuitem> alat iz <guimenu> Uređaji </"
"guimenu> menia. Ovaj alat je neaktivan dok ne uspostavi veza na sliku "
"uređaja."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Capture Image Sequence</title>"
msgstr "<title>USlikaj Vise Slika</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Capture"
msgstr "Snimi"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Slika"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Capture Image Sequence tool can be used to aquire images from cameras "
"and CCDs in interactive and batch modes. Furthermore, you can select which "
"filter, if any, you want to use for your images. The capture tool remains "
"disabled until you establish a connection to an imaging device."
msgstr ""
"Alat za snimanje više slika se može koristiti za stjecanje slike iz kamere i "
"CCD u interaktivnom  i seriskom načinu . Osim toga, možete odabrati koje "
"filter, ako ih ima, želite koristiti za svoje slike.Alat za snimanje i dalje "
"onemogućen dok ne uspostavi vezu s uređajem za snimanje."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: indi.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Capture Image Sequence</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uslikaj više slika</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above screenshot depicts a sample capture session. The tool provides the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Zaslon iznad  prikazuje uslikanu jednu sesiju .Alat pruža sljedeće "
"mogućnosti:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Camera/CCD"
msgstr "Kamera/CCD"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>Device:</option> The desired imaging device."
msgstr "<option>Uređaji:</option> Zeljeni uređaj za slike."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Prefix:</option> The image prefix which will be prepended to each "
"captured filename."
msgstr ""
"<option>Prefiks:</option> Slika prefiks koji će biti stavljen na svakoj "
"snimljenoj datoteci."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>Exposure:</option> The number of seconds to expose each frame."
msgstr "<option>Izlaganje:</option> Broj sekundi za svaki okvir."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>Count:</option> The number of images to aquire."
msgstr "<option>Broji:</option> Broj slika a usikati."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Delay:</option> The delay in seconds between consecutive images."
msgstr ""
"<option>Kašnjenje:</option> Kasnjenje u sekundama između uzastopnih slika."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>ISO 8601 time stamp:</option> Append ISO 8601 time stamp to the "
"filename. (e.g. image_01_20050427T09:48:05)."
msgstr ""
"<option>ISO 8601 vremwnski pečat:</option> Dodati ISO 8601vremenski pečat na "
"fajl. (e.g. image_01_20050427T09:48:05)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filter"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>Device:</option> The desired filter device."
msgstr "<option>Uređaj :</option>Željeni filter uređaj."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Filter:</option> The desired filter slot. You can assign color "
"values to slot numbers using the <link linkend=\"indi-configure\">INDI</"
"link> page (e.g. Slot #1 = Red, Slot #2 = Blue..etc)."
msgstr ""
"<option>Filter:</option> Željeni slot za filter. Možete dodijeliti "
"vrijednosti boja slot brojevima pomoću<link linkend=\"indi-configure\">INDI</"
"link> strane (e.g. Slot #1 = Crvena, Slot #2 =Plava..itd)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you fill in the desired options, you can begin the capture procedure "
"by pressing the <guibutton>Start</guibutton> button. You may cancel at any "
"time using the <guibutton>Stop</guibutton> button. All captured images will "
"be saved to the default FITS directory which can be specified in the <link "
"linkend=\"indi-configure\">INDI</link> page of the settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ispunite željene opcije, možete početi postupak snimanja pritiskom "
"na <guibutton> Početak </guibutton> dugme. Vi mozete otkazati u bilo koje "
"vrijeme pomoću <guibutton> stop </guibutton> dugmeta . Sve snimljene "
"fotografije će biti spremljena na zadano moguće učitati katalog koji može "
"biti naveden na <link linkend=\"indi-configure\">INDI</link> stranici od "
"prozora za pomoć."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have more complex capturing requirements and conditions to fulfil, it "
"is recommended to create a script to meet your specific needs using the "
"<link linkend=\"tool-scriptbuilder\">Script Builder</link> tool in the "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate složenije zahtjeve i uvjete za ispunjenje snimanje, preporučljivo "
"je stvoriti skriptu kako bi zadovoljili vaše specifične potrebe pomoću <link "
"linkend=\"tool-scriptbuilder\">Script Builder</link>alat u <guimenu> Alati </"
"guimenu> meniu."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure INDI"
msgstr "Podesi INDI"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Konfiguriši"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "<secondary>INDI</secondary>"
msgstr "<secondary>INDI</secondary>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The INDI page allows you to modify <emphasis>Client side</emphasis> INDI "
"specific options. The window is divided into several main categories: "
"General, Automatic device updates, Display, Update Source, Filter Wheel and "
"Server Port:"
msgstr ""
"Stranica INDI vam omogućuje da izmijenite<emphasis>Stranu klijenta </"
"emphasis>INDI određene opcije. Prozor je podijeljen u nekoliko glavnih "
"kategorija: Generlano, automatsko ažuriranje uređaja, prikaz, izvor "
"ažuriranja, Filter kotača i Server Port:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Opšte"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Default FITS directory:</option> Specify the directory where all "
"captured FITS images will be saved to. If no directory is specified, images "
"will be stored in $HOME."
msgstr ""
"<option>Zadani FITS direktorij :</option> Specificira direktorij gdje ce sve "
"FITS slike biti sacuvane.Ako nijedan direktorij nje specificiran, slika će "
"biti sačuvana na $HOME."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Telescope port:</option> The default telescope port. When you "
"connect to a local or remote telescope service, &kstars; will automatically "
"fill the telescope's device port with the specified default port."
msgstr ""
"<option>Teleskop portt:</option> Zadani telesop port .Kada se konektujete na "
"lokalni ili daljinski teleskop servis, &kstars; ce automatski popouniti "
"teleskop portod uređaja sa specificiranim zadim portom."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Video port:</option> The default video port. When you connect to a "
"local or remote video service, &kstars; will automatically fill the webcam's "
"device port with the specified default port."
msgstr ""
"<option>Video port:</option> Zadani Video port.Kada se konektujete na "
"lokalni ili daljnski vio servis, &kstars; će automatski popuniti port za web "
"kameru sa zadanim portom ."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic device updates"
msgstr "Automatska auzriranja uređaja"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Time:</option> Update the telescope's date and time, if supported, "
"upon connection."
msgstr ""
"<option>Vrijeme:</option>Ažurira datum i vrijeme teleskopa , ako je "
"potrzano, kada je konektovano."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Geographic location:</option> Update the telescope's geographical "
"location information (current longitude and latitude), if supported, upon "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"<option>Geografska lokacija:</option> Ažurira informacije o geografskoj "
"lokaciji teleskopa  (trnutna sirina i visina), ako je podržano, kada je "
"konektovano."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Ekran"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Device target crosshair:</option> When checked, &kstars; displays "
"the telescope's target crosshair on the sky map. The crosshair is displayed "
"upon a successful connection to the telescope and its location is updated "
"periodically. The telescope's name is displayed next to the crosshair. "
"&kstars; displays one crosshair per each connected telescope. To change the "
"color of the telescope's crosshair, open the <link linkend=\"viewops"
"\">Configure &kstars;</link> window. Select the <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> "
"tab, and then change the color of the <emphasis>Target Indicator</emphasis> "
"item to the desired color."
msgstr ""
"<option>Nišan uređaja:</option> Kad odabran, &kstars; prikazuje metu "
"teleskopa na mapi neba.Nišan se prikazuje uz uspješnu vezu sa  teleskopom i "
"njegovim položajem pa se  ažuriraju redovito. Naziv teleskopa  se prikazuje "
"pored nišana. &kstars; prikazuje jedan nišan po svaku povezanom teleskopu. "
"Da biste promijenili boju nišana teleskopa , otvorite <link linkend = "
"\"viewops\"> Konfiguracija &kstars; </link> prozor. Odaberite karticu "
"<guilabel> Boje </guilabel>, a zatim promijenite boju <emphasis> Indikator "
"Mete</emphasis> stavku na željenu boju."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>INDI messages in status bar:</option> When checked, &kstars; "
"displays INDI status messages in the &kstars; status bar."
msgstr ""
"<option>INDI poruku u status traci :</option> Kada je odabrano, &kstars; "
"prikazuje INDI statusnu poruku u  &kstars; statusnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>Automatic Display of FITS upon capture:</option> When checked, "
"&kstars; will display captured FITS in &kstars; <link linkend=\"tool-"
"fitsviewer\">FITS Viewer</link> tool. If you use the <link linkend=\"indi-"
"capture\">Capture Image Sequence</link> tool, all captured images will be "
"saved to disk regardless of this option."
msgstr ""
"<option> Automatski Prikaz FITS nakon slikanja: </option> Kad je odabrano , "
"&kstars;ce prikazati uslikane FITS &kstars;   <link linkend=\"tool-fitsviewer"
"\">FITS Preglednik </link>alat. Ako koristite <link linkend = \"indi-capture"
"\"> Slikanje uzastopnih slika </link> alat,  sve snimljene slike će se "
"spremiti na disk, bez obzira na tu opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Update Source: Synchronize &kstars; according to either the computer or "
"device time and location settings."
msgstr ""
"Ažuriraj izvor: Sinhronizira &kstar; prema bilo na računalu ili uređaju "
"vrijeme i postavke položaja."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Filter Wheel: Assign color codes to the filter wheel slots (e.g. Slot #0 "
"Red, Slot #1 Blue..etc). You can assign color codes for up to 10 filter "
"slots (0 to 9). To assign a color code, select a slot number from the drop "
"down combo box, and then type the corresponding color code in the edit "
"field. Repeat the process for all desired slots and then press OK."
msgstr ""
"Filter kotača: Dodjela kodove boja slotovima filteru kotača (npr Slot # 0 "
"Crnena, Slot # 1 Plava..itd). Možete dodijeliti kodove boji do 10 filter "
"slotova (0-9). Za dodjelu šifru boje, odaberite broj otvora s padom "
"kombiniranog okvira prema dolje, a zatim upišite odgovarajuću boju kod u "
"polje uredi. Ponovite postupak za sve željene utora, a zatim pritisnite OK."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Server Port: Specify range of ports that INDI Server will bind to when "
"starting new drivers."
msgstr ""
"Server Port: Specificira rang portova koje INDI Server moze vezati kada "
"pokreće nove drajvere."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Concepts"
msgstr "INDI Pojmovi"

#. Tag: primary
#: indi.docbook:307 indi.docbook:402 indi.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "Telescope Control"
msgstr "Upravljanje teleskopom"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "Pojmovi"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main key concept in INDI is that devices have the ability to describe "
"themselves. This is accomplished by using XML to describe a generic "
"hierarchy that can represent both canonical and non-canonical devices. In "
"INDI, all <emphasis>devices</emphasis> may contain one or more "
"<emphasis>properties</emphasis>. Any <emphasis>property</emphasis> may "
"contain one or more <emphasis>elements</emphasis>. There are four types of "
"INDI properties:"
msgstr ""
"Glavni ključni pojam u INDI je da uređaji imaju mogućnost da se opišu . To "
"se postiže pomoću XML  generičku strukturu koja može predstavljati oba "
"kanonske i nekanonskoj uređaja. U Indi, svi <emphasis>uređaji </emphasis>  "
"mogu sadržavati jedanu ili više <emphasis>osobina  </emphasis>. Svaka "
"<emphasis>osobina </emphasis> može sadržavati jedan ili više "
"<emphasis>elemenata</emphasis>. Postoje četiri vrste INDI osobina:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text property."
msgstr "Tekst osobine."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number property."
msgstr "Numeričko svojstvo."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch property (Represented in GUI by buttons and checkboxes)."
msgstr "Osobine Prekidača (zastupljeni u GUI-u od   dugmadi i checkbox-ova)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light property (Represented in GUI by colored LEDs)."
msgstr "Osobine Osvjetljenja (Zastupljeni u GUI-u od LED dioda)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, all INDI devices share the CONNECTION standard switch "
"<emphasis>property</emphasis>. The CONNECTION property has two elements: "
"CONNECT and DISCONNECT switches. &kstars; parses the generic XML description "
"of properties and builds a GUI representation suitable for direct human "
"interaction."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, svi INDI uređaje dijele vezu standardne promijenjive "
"<emphasis>osobine</emphasis>. Osobine Konekcije imaju dva elementa : "
"Ukljuceni i iskluceni prekidaci. &kstars; analiza generičke XML opise "
"svojstava i gradi GUI prikaz pogodan za izravnu ljudsku interakciju."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The INDI control panel offers many device properties not accessible from the "
"sky map. The properties offered differ from one device to another. "
"Nevertheless, all properties share common features that constrains how they "
"are displayed and used:"
msgstr ""
"Kontrola INDI ploča nudi mnoge osobine uređaj koje nisu dostupne nebeskoj "
"karti. Svojstva koja se nude  razlikuju se od jednog uređaja do drugog. "
"Ipak, sve osobine dijele zajedničke značajke koje ograničava koliko su "
"prikazane i koristene:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Permission: All properties can either be read-only, write-only, or read and "
"write enabled. An example of a read-write property is the telescope's Right "
"Ascension. You can enter a new Right Ascension and the telescope, based on "
"current settings, will either slew or sync to the new input. Furthermore, "
"when the telescope slews, its Right Ascension gets updated and sent back to "
"the client."
msgstr ""
"Dopuštenje: Sve svojstva se mogu  ili samo čitati, pisati, ili samo čitati i "
"pisati .Primjer osobine čitanja i pisanja  je teleskopska Rektascenzija. "
"Možete unijeti novi rektascenziji i teleskop, na temelju trenutnih postavki, "
"ili će biti urađena sinkronizacija s novim ulazom. Nadalje, kada je teleskop "
"pomjeri , njegova Rektascenzija biva ažurirana i poslana natrag klijentu."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"State: Prefixed to each property is a state indicator (round LED). Each "
"property has a state and an associated color code:"
msgstr ""
"State:Prefiks za svako stanje  je indikator stanja (okrugli LED). Svaki "
"objekt imati stanje i pripadni cod boje:"

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI State color code"
msgstr "INDI stanje kodova boja"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "State"
msgstr "Stanje"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Boja"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Neaktivno"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gray"
msgstr "Siva"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "Device is performing no action with respect to this property"
msgstr "Uređaj obavlja nikakvu akciju s obzirom na osobine"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Ok</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>U redu</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Zelena"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "Last operation performed on this property was successful and active"
msgstr ""
"Zadnja operacija izvedena nad ovom osobinom je izvedena uspješno i aktivna je"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Busy"
msgstr "Zauzet"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yellow"
msgstr "Žuta"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "The property is performing an action"
msgstr "Osobina  izvodi radnju"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "Alert"
msgstr "Upozorenje"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Red</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>Crvena</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: indi.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "The property is in critical condition and needs immediate attention"
msgstr "Ova osobina je u kritičnom stanju i potrebno je trenutno reagovati"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The device driver updates the property state in real-time when necessary. "
"For example, if the telescope is in the process of slewing to a target, then "
"the RA/DEC properties will be signaled as <guilabel>Busy</guilabel>. When "
"the slew process is completed successfully, the properties will be signaled "
"as <guilabel>Ok</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Drajver uređaj ažurira stanje osobina u realnom vremenu kada je to potrebno. "
"Na primjer, ako teleskop je u procesu okretanja na metu, onda RA / DEC "
"svojstva će biti signalizirano kao <guilabel> Zauzeto</guilabel>. Kad proces "
"naglog pomjeranja  uspješno završen, svojstva će biti signalizirano kao "
"<guilabel> Uredu </guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Context: Numerical properties can accept and process numbers in two formats: "
"decimal and sexagesimal. The sexagesimal format is convenient when "
"expressing time or equatorial/geographical coordinates. You can use any "
"format at your convenience. For example, all the following numbers are equal:"
msgstr ""
"Kontekst: Numerički svojstva mogu prihvatiti i obraditi brojeva u dva "
"formata: decimale i seksagezimalni  .seksagezimalni format je zgodan kada se "
"izražava vrijeme ili ekvatorijalne / zemljopisne koordinate. Možete "
"koristiti bilo koji format koji vam odgovara. Na primjer, svi sljedeći "
"brojevi su jednaki:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "-156.40"
msgstr "-156.40"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "-156:24:00"
msgstr "-156:24:00"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "-156:24"
msgstr "-156:24"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Time: The standard time for all INDI-related communications is Universal "
"Time UTC specified as YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS in accord with ISO 8601. &kstars; "
"communicates the correct UTC time with device drivers automatically. You can "
"enable/disable automatic time updates from the <guimenuitem>INDI</"
"guimenuitem> page in the settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Vrijeme: standardno vrijeme za sve komunikacije INDI je  Universal Time UTC "
"naveden kao GGGG-MM-DD hh: mm: ss u skladu s ISO 8601. &kstars; podesava "
"korektmo UTC vrijeme sa drajverima uređaja automatski. Možete omogućiti / "
"onemogućiti automatsko  ažuriranje vrijema  od <guimenuitem> INDI </"
"guimenuitem> stranica u dijalogu sa postavkama."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remote Device Control"
msgstr "Uređaj za daljinsko urevaljanje"

#. Tag: secondary
#: indi.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remote Devices"
msgstr "Daljinski uređaj"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; provides a simple yet powerful layer for remote device control. A "
"detailed description of the layer is described in the INDI <ulink url="
"\"http://www.clearskyinstitute.com/INDI/INDI.pdf\">white paper</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&kstars;podrzva jednostavnu a jak sloj za upravljne daljinski uređaja. "
"Detaljno objašnjenje sloja je objašnjeno u INDI <ulink url=\"http://www."
"clearskyinstitute.com/INDI/INDI.pdf\">bijelom papiru</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to configure both the server and client machines for remote control:"
msgstr ""
"Moraju se konfigurisati i server i klijent mašine za daljinsko upravljanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Server: To prepare a device for remote control, follow the same steps in the "
"<link linkend=\"indi-kstars-setup\">local/server</link> setup. When you "
"start a device service in the <guimenu>Device Manager</guimenu>, a port "
"number is displayed under the <guilabel>Listening port</guilabel> column. In "
"addition to the port number, you also need the hostname or IP address of "
"your server."
msgstr ""
"Server: ZA pripremanje za daljinsko upravljanje, slijedite jednostavne "
"korake <link linkend=\"indi-kstars-setup\">local/server</link> postavki. "
"KAda pokrenete servis uređaja u  <guimenu>Upravljaču Uređaja</guimenu>,a "
"broj porta je prikazan ispod <guilabel>porata za slušanje</guilabel> kolone. "
"Kao dodatak broju porta,također će trebati hostname ili IP adresa od vašeg "
"servera."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Client: Select the <guimenuitem>Device Manager</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Device</guimenu> menu and click on the <guilabel>Client</guilabel> "
"tab. You can add, modify, or delete hosts under the <guilabel>Client</"
"guilabel> tab. Add a host by clicking on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> "
"button. Enter the hostname/IP address of the server in the <guilabel>Host</"
"guilabel> field, and enter the port number obtained from the "
"<emphasis>server</emphasis> machine in step 1."
msgstr ""
"Klijent: Odaberite <guimenuitem>Upravčjač uređaja </guimenuitem> od "
"<guimenu> Uređaj </guimenu> menia i kliknite na <guilabel>klijent  </"
"guilabel> krticu . Možete dodavati, mijenjati ili brisati domaćina pod "
"<guilabel> klijent  </guilabel>karticom . Dodaj domaćina klikom na "
"<guibutton> Dodaj </guibutton> gumb. Unesite naziv domaćina / IP adresu "
"servera u <guilabel> Domaćin </guilabel> polje , te unesite broj porta "
"dobivene od <emphasis>serverske</emphasis> mašine u koraku 1."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: indi.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Client"
msgstr "INDI klijent"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you add a host, right click on the host to <guimenuitem>Connect</"
"guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Disconnect</guimenuitem>. If a connection is "
"established, you can control the telescope from the <guilabel>Sky map</"
"guilabel> or <guilabel>INDI Control Panel</guilabel> exactly as described in "
"the <link linkend=\"indi-kstars-setup\">local/server</link> section. It is "
"as easy at that."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što dodate domaćina, desni klik na domaćina <guimenuitem> Povezivanje "
"</guimenuitem> ili <guimenuitem> Odspoji </guimenuitem>. Ako je "
"uspostavljena veza, možete kontrolirati teleskop od <guilabel> nebeske mape "
"</guilabel> ili <guilabel> INDI Kontrolen Ploče </guilabel> točno onako kako "
"je opisano u<link linkend=\"indi-kstars-setup\">local/server</"
"link>poglavlje. To je samo tako lako."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "Running an INDI server from the command line"
msgstr "Pokretanje INDI servera iz komandne linjie"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While &kstars; allows you to easily deploy an INDI server; you can launch an "
"INDI server from the command line."
msgstr ""
"Dok &kstars; dopušta da jednostavno razvijemo INDI server ;može se pokrenuti "
"INDI sever iz komandne linije."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since INDI is an independent backend component, you can run an INDI server "
"on a host without &kstars;. INDI can be compiled separately to run on remote "
"hosts. Furthermore, device drivers log messages to <constant>stderr</"
"constant> and that can be helpful in a debugging situation. The syntax for "
"INDI server is as following:"
msgstr ""
"Budući INDI je samostalna komponenta pozadine, možete pokrenuti INDI server "
"na računalu, bez i &kstars;. INDI može sastaviti posebno za rad na udaljenim "
"računalima. Nadalje, upravljačke programe uređaja prijaviti poruke na "
"<constant>stderr</constant> a to može biti od pomoći u ispravljanje "
"pogrešaka situaciji.Sintaksa za INDI servere  je kako slijedi:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"$ <command>indiserver</command> [options] [<filename>driver</filename> ...]"
msgstr ""
"$ <command>indiserver</command> [options] [<filename>driver</filename> ...]"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "-l d : log driver messages to d/YYYY-MM-DD.islog"
msgstr "-l d : prijavite poruku drajvera na  d/GGGG-MM--DD.islog"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid "-m m : kill client if gets more than this many MB behind, default 10"
msgstr "-m m : ugasi klijenta ako dobije vise od ovoliko MB iza, zadano 10"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid "-p p : alternate IP port, default 7624"
msgstr "-p p : alternativni IP port, zadani 7624"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "-v : show key events, no traffic"
msgstr "-v : prikaži ključne elemente, bez saobraćaja"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "-vv : -v + key message content"
msgstr "-vv : -v + sadražaj ključne poruke"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid "-vvv : -vv + complete xml"
msgstr "-vvv : -vv + kompletan xml"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid "driver : executable or device@host[:port]"
msgstr "drajver : izvritelj ili uređaj @host[:port]"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you want to start an INDI server running an LX200 GPS driver "
"and listening to connections on port 8000, you would run the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Kao primjer, ako želimo starti INDI server kao LX2000 GPS drajver i pratiti "
"konekciju na portu 8000, pokrenuli bi sljedeću komandu:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "$ <command>indiserver</command> -p 8000 <filename>lx200gps</filename>"
msgstr "$ <command>indiserver</command> -p 8000 <filename>lx200gps</filename>"

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid "Secure Remote Operation"
msgstr "Izvor daljinske operacije"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Suppose we want to run an indiserver with INDI drivers on a remote host, "
"<constant>remote_host</constant>, and connect them to &kstars; running on "
"the local machine."
msgstr ""
"Predpostavimo da želimo da pokrenemo indiserver sa INDI drajverima na "
"daljinskom uređaju , <constant>daljinski_host</constant>, i konektuj se na "
"&kstars; pokrenut na lokalnoj mašini."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the local machine log onto the remote host, <constant>remote_host</"
"constant>, by typing:"
msgstr ""
"Sa lokalne mašine prijavi se na daljinski host,<constant>daljinski_host</"
"constant>,kucajući:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"$ <command>ssh</command> -L <varname>local_port</varname>:"
"<constant>remote_host</constant>:<varname>remote_port</varname>"
msgstr ""
"$ <command>ssh</command> -L <varname>local_port</varname>:"
"<constant>remote_host</constant>:<varname>remote_port</varname>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This binds the <varname>local_port</varname> on the local machine to the "
"<varname>remote_port</varname> on the <constant>remote_host</constant>. "
"After logging in, run indiserver on the remote host:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo veže  <varname>lokalni_port</varname> na lokalnu mašinu "
"<varname>daljinski port </varname>na <constant>daljinski_host</constant>. "
"Nakon prijavljivanj, poreni indiserver na daljinskom host-u:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"$ <command>indiserver</command> -p <varname>remote_port</varname> "
"[<filename>driver</filename>...]"
msgstr ""
"$ <command>indiserver</command> -p <varname>remote_port</varname> "
"[<filename>driver</filename>...]"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Back on the local machine, start &kstars; then open the <guimenuitem>Device "
"Manager</guimenuitem> and add a host under the <guilabel>Client</guilabel> "
"tab. The host should be the local host (usually 127.0.0.1) and the port "
"number should be the <varname>local_port</varname> used in the steps above. "
"<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton>-click on the host and select "
"<guimenuitem>Connect</guimenuitem> from the popup menu. &kstars; will "
"connect to the remote INDI server securely. The host information will be "
"saved for future sessions."
msgstr ""
"Natrag na lokalnom računalu, pokreni i &kstars; zatim otvorite  "
"<guimenuitem>Upravljač Uređaja  </guimenuitem> i dodaj domaćina na kartici "
"<guilabel> Klijent</guilabel>.Domaćin bi trebao biti lokalno računalo "
"(obično 127.0.0.1) i broj porta trebao biti <varname> lokalni_port </"
"varname> korišten u gore navedenim koracima. <mousebutton> Desno</"
"mousebutton> -Kliknite na računalu i odaberite <guimenuitem> Povezivanje </"
"guimenuitem> iz popup menia . &kstars; će se spojiti na udaljeni INDI "
"server  sigurno. Informacije domaćina će biti spremljena za buduće sjednice."

#. Tag: title
#: indi.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "INDI Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "INDI Često postavljenja pitanja"

#. Tag: acronym
#: indi.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>FAQ</acronym>"
msgstr "<acronym>FAQ</acronym>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is INDI?"
msgstr "Šta je INDI?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>INDI</acronym> is the <ulink url=\"http://indi.sourceforge.net\"> "
"Instrument-Neutral-Distributed-Interface</ulink> control protocol developed "
"by <author><firstname>Elwood</firstname><surname>C. Downey</surname></"
"author> of <ulink url=\"http://www.clearskyinstitute.com/\">ClearSky "
"Institute</ulink>. &kstars; employs device drivers that are compatible with "
"the INDI protocol. INDI has many advantages including loose coupling between "
"hardware devices and software drivers. Clients that use the device drivers "
"(like &kstars;) are completely unaware of the device capabilities. In run "
"time, &kstars; communicates with the device drivers and builds a completely "
"dynamical GUI based on services provided by the device. Therefore, new "
"device drivers can be written or updated and &kstars; can take full "
"advantage of them without any changes on the client side."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>INDI</acronym> je <ulink url=\"http://indi.sourceforge.net\"> "
"Instrument-Neutral-Distributed-Interface</ulink> protokol za kontrolu razvio "
"<author> <firstname>Elwood</firstname><surname>C. Downey</surname></author> "
"od <ulink url=\"http://www.clearskyinstitute.com/\">ClearSky Institute</"
"ulink>. &kstars; zapošljava upravljačke programe uređaja koji su u skladu s "
"protokolom Indi. INDI ima mnoge prednosti, uključujući labave spojnice "
"između hardverskih uređaja i softverski drajvera. Klijenti koji koriste i "
"upravljačke programe uređaja (kaoi &kstars;) su potpuno svjesni mogućnosti "
"uređaja. U vrijeme izvođenja, i &kstars; komunicira s upravljačkim "
"programom  i gradi potpuno dinamički gui koji se temelji na uslugma koje "
"nudi uređaj. Dakle, novi drajveri za urđaje mogu biti napisani ili ažuriran "
"i &kstars; može u potpunosti iskoristiti ih bez ikakvih promjena na strani "
"klijenta."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do you plan to support more devices?"
msgstr "Da li planirate da podrzite više uređaja?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. We plan to support major CCD cameras and focusers and extend support "
"for more telescopes. If you would like INDI to support a particular device, "
"please send an email to <email>indi-devel@lists.sourceforge.net</email>"
msgstr ""
"Da. Mi planiramo podržati glavne CCD kamere i fokusere i proširiti podršku "
"za više teleskopa. Ako želite da INDI podrži određeni uređaj, molimo vas da "
"pošaljete e-mail na <email>indi-devel@lists.sourceforge.net</email>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:523
#, no-c-format
msgid "What operations does &kstars; provide to control the telescope?"
msgstr "Koje operacije  &kstars; podržava da bi se pontrolisao teleskop?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:528
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It depends on the particular telescope you're running, but the minimum three "
"operations are <command>Slew</command>, <command>Track</command>, and "
"<command>Sync</command>, which you can issue directly from the sky map. Your "
"telescope must be aligned for those operations to perform correctly. Some "
"telescopes offer you more operations like site management, slew modes, "
"focusing, parking, and more. You can access the telescopes extended features "
"from the INDI Control Panel in the Devices Menu."
msgstr ""
"To ovisi o pojedinom teleskop koji prikazujete, ali najmanje tri operacije "
"<command>Pomjeri</command>, <command>Prati</command>, and "
"<command>Sinhroniziraj </command>, koje možete izdati izravnona nebeskoj "
"mapi. Vaš teleskop mora biti usklađen za ove radnje ispravno. Neki teleskopi "
"vam ponudi više operacija kao što su upravljanje stranicama,načini "
"pomjeranja , fokusiranje, pauziranje , i još mnogo toga. Možete pristupiti "
"teleskop proširenjima na upravljačkoj ploči INDI u Uređaj meniu ."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use &kstars; to do guiding?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristi &kstars; da radim vođenje?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently, there are no plans to support guiding in &kstars;. Users may "
"utilize <ulink url=\"http://code.google.com/p/open-phd-guiding/\">OpenPHD "
"Guiding</ulink> as it is compatible with &kstars; and INDI."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno ne postoje planovi za podršku vodilja u &kstars;. Korisnici mogu "
"koristiti  <ulink url=\"http://code.google.com/p/open-phd-guiding/\">OpenPHD "
"Vodić</ulink> kao što je to u skaldu s  &kstars; i INDI."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What's the difference between <command>Slew</command>, <command>Track</"
"command>, and <command>Sync</command> exactly?"
msgstr ""
"Koja je razlika između <command>Pomjeri </command>, <command>Prati</"
"command>, i <command>Sihhroniziraj </command> tačno?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The command <command>Slew</command> orders the telescope to move to a "
"particular target, and once the telescope reaches its target, the telescope "
"keeps tracking that target at a <emphasis>sidereal</emphasis> rate (i.e. the "
"rate at which stars move across the sky). This works well for stars, Messier "
"objects, and about everything outside our solar system. But solar system "
"objects travel differently across the sky and so the telescope must "
"<command>Track</command> the objects as they move."
msgstr ""
"Naredba  <command> pomjeri </command> naređuje teleskopu da se pomjeru u "
"određenom pravcu, a jednom kada  teleskop dosegne svoj cilj, teleskop drži "
"praćenje tog cilja na <emphasis>zvjezdana</emphasis>Brzina (tj brzina kojom "
"se zvijezde kretaju  po nebu). To dobro radi za zvijezde, Messier objekte, "
"te o svemu izvan našeg Sunčevog sustava. Ali  predmeti Solarnog Sistema "
"putuju drugačijim nebom i tako teleskop mora <command>pratiti </command> "
"predmeti kako se on kreće."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Therefore, you need to issue a track command if you want to track an object "
"with non-sidereal motion. On the other hand, <command>Sync</command> is used "
"to synchronize the telescope's internal coordinates with that of an object "
"you select."
msgstr ""
"Dakle, potrebno je izdati naredbu praćenja, ako želite pratiti objekt koji "
"nema kretanje zvijezde. S druge strane, <command>Sinhroniziraj</command> se "
"koristi za sinkronizaciju teleskopske unutarnje koordinate s onom objekta "
"koji ste odabrali."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I control my telescope remotely?"
msgstr "Mogu li kontrolisati svoj teleskop daljinski?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can start an INDI server on the machine connected to your telescope "
"and the server will listen to requests from &kstars; clients. Once you're "
"connected, you can control your telescope directly from the sky map. This "
"procedure is described in detail in the <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control"
"\">Remote device control</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Da. Možete pokrenuti INDI server na stroju spojen na svoj teleskop i server "
"će registrovati zahtjeve &kstars; klijenta. Kada ste povezani, možete "
"kontrolirati svoj teleskop izravno iz nebeske mape. Ovaj postupak je "
"detaljno biti opisan u <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control\">Daljinsko "
"upravljanje uređajima</link> sekciji."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:578
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When I try to <guibutton>Connect</guibutton>, &kstars; reports that the "
"telescope is not connected to the serial/USB port. What can I do?"
msgstr ""
"Kad se pokušam <guibutton> Povezati </guibutton> &kstars; izvještava da "
"teleskop nije spojen na serijski / USB port. Što mogu učiniti?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This message is triggered when &kstars; cannot communicate with the "
"telescope. Here are few things you can do:"
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka se aktivira kada &kstars; ne moze komunicirati s teleskopom. Evo "
"nekoliko stvari koje možete učiniti:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check that you have both reading and writing permission for the port you are "
"trying to connect to."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite da li imate dozvolu za oboje pisanje i citanje za priključak na "
"koji se pokušavate spojiti."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the connection cable, make sure it is in good condition and test it "
"with other applications."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite priključak kabela, pobrinite se da je u dobrom stanju i testirati "
"ga s drugim aplikacijama."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check your telescope power, make sure the power is on and that the telescope "
"is getting enough power."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite snagu svoga teleskopa, provjerite je li napajanje uključeno i da "
"li teleskop dobiva dovoljno snage."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set the correct port in the <guilabel>INDI Control Panel</guilabel> under "
"the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu. The default device is <constant>/dev/"
"ttyS0</constant>"
msgstr ""
"Postavite ispravan priključak na <guilabel> Indi upravljačkoj ploči </"
"guilabel> pod <guimenu> Uređaji </guimenu> meniu . Zadani uređaj je "
"<constant>/dev/ttyS0</constant>"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restart &kstars; and retry again."
msgstr "Restartuj &kstars; i pokušaj ponovo."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; reports that the telescope is online and ready, but I cannot find "
"the telescope's crosshair, where is it?"
msgstr ""
"&kstars; izvještava da je teleskop je uključen i spreman, ali ja ne mogu "
"naći nišan teleskopa, gdje je to?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; retrieves the telescopes RA and DEC coordinates upon connection. If "
"your alignment was performed correctly, then you should see the crosshair "
"around your target in the Sky Map. However, the RA and DEC coordinates "
"provided by the telescope may be incorrect (even below the horizon) and you "
"need to <link linkend=\"indi-sync\">Sync</link> your telescope to your "
"current target. You can use the right-click menu to center and track the "
"telescope crosshair in the sky map."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; dohvaća teleskopi RA i DEC koordinate na vezi. Ako je vaše "
"poravnanje je izvršeno ispravno, trbali biste vidjeti nišan oko svog cilja "
"na nebeskoj mapi. Međutim, RA i DEC koordinate  teleskopa mogu biti netačne "
"(čak ispod horizonta), a vi trebate<link linkend=\"indi-sync"
"\">Sinhronizirati</link> Vašem teleskop na svoj trenutni cilj. Možete "
"koristiti izbornik desnim klikom na centar i pratiti nišan teleskopa na "
"nebeskoj mapi."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:619
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The telescope is moving erratically or not moving at all. What can I do?"
msgstr "Teleskop se kreće neizvjesno ili ne kreće uopće. Što mogu učiniti?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This behavior is mostly due to incorrect settings, please verify the "
"following check list:"
msgstr ""
"Takvo ponašanje je uglavnom zbog pogrešnih postavki, provjerite sljedeće "
"stavke:"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is the telescope aligned?"
msgstr "Da li je teleskop poravnat?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Is the telescope alignment mode correct? Use <guilabel>INDI Control Panel</"
"guilabel> to check and change these settings (<constant>Alt/Az,Polar, Land</"
"constant>)."
msgstr ""
"Da li je teleskop poravnat na pravi način ? Koristi <guilabel>INDI Kontrolnu "
"ploču</guilabel> da bi se markirale i promijenile postavke  (<constant>Alt/"
"Az,Polar, Land</constant>)."

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:631
#, no-c-format
msgid "Are the telescope's time and date settings correct?"
msgstr "Da li su postavke za datum i vrijeme teleskopa tačne?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:634
#, no-c-format
msgid "Are the telescope's longitude and latitude settings correct?"
msgstr "Jesu li  širina i dužina tekeskopa postavljene tačno?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is the telescope's UTC offset correct?"
msgstr "Da li je teleskopov UTC pomak korektan ?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:640
#, no-c-format
msgid "Are the telescope's RA and DEC axis locked firmly?"
msgstr "Jeste teleskopske RA i DEC osovine  zaključane čvrsto?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Is the telescope's N/S switch (when applicable) setup correctly for your "
"hemisphere?"
msgstr ""
"Da li je N/S prekidač od teleskopa  (ako je primjenjen) postavljen ispravno "
"za vašu hemisferu?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:646
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is the cable between the telescope and computer in good condition?"
msgstr "Je li  kabal između teleskopa i računala u dobrom stanju?"

#. Tag: para
#: indi.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you think all settings are correct but the telescope still moves "
"erratically or not at all, then please send a report to <email>indi-"
"devel@lists.sourceforge.net</email>"
msgstr ""
"Ako mislite da su sve postavke točne, ali teleskop i dalje kreće neizvjesno, "
"ili nikako, onda molimo poslati izještaj na <email>indi-devel@lists."
"sourceforge.net</email>"
